  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Senegal&apos;s Fiscal Sustainability Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The operation aims to strengthen Senegal&apos;s fiscal sustainability through improved debt sustainability, robust public financial management, and increased domestic resource mobilization. It will focus on three main results areas: (i) RA 1: Strengthen Public Financial Management. This results area supports greater efficiency, accountability, and transparency in PFM, with a view towards creating fiscal space to fund service delivery and respond to economic and climate-shocks, without impacting Senegal&apos;s debt sustainability. (ii) RA 2: Improve Public Debt Sustainability. This area supports enhanced debt sustainability, transparency, and implementation of policy reforms envisaged under the upcoming RESET DPF series with a view to reducing the stock of the public debt.(iii) RA 3: Increase Domestic Resource Mobilization. This results area supports enhanced and transparent DRM, aiming at increasing revenue mobilization to create fiscal space to fund service delivery and respond to shocks.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve public debt sustainability, strengthen public financial management, and increase domestic resource mobilization.</narrative>
  </description>
